cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Yuyang Dongtian Garden Walk (玉阳洞天游园)"
abstract: >-
  A free browser game that rebuilds the Ming blue-and-green handscroll
  Yuyang Dongtian (bearing the signature of Qiu Ying, Tianjin Museum) as one
  continuous, walkable 3D world of thirteen scenes, aligned to the painting by
  back-projecting a "painting view" camera for each scene. Made by Yang Li
  together with Claude (Anthropic), an AI coding agent.
authors:
  - given-names: Yang
    family-names: Li
    affiliation: Independent artist
